  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening peasants farmers against extractivism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will be carried out in two regions of Colombia: Cajamarca, in the department of Tolima, and in El Carmen de Atrato, in the department of Choc&#xf3;, through three lines of action: (i) contribute to the advancement of the processes of enforceability for the guarantee and respect of the rights of peasant farmers in relation to the decisions that affect their territories; (ii) strengthen peasant farmers as subjects of rights in Colombia; and (iii) influence legal reforms in relation to the extractive model in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
